{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 27, :comments ["<b>The sockets of the sanctuary and the sockets of the parochet.</b> That they were one hundred — how so? For the forty-eight planks of the mishkan, ninety-six sockets were needed, two sockets under each plank, and four for the parochet — that makes one hundred."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 38, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:02:10.103649145Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}